     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜にかけては: as for; with regard to",
     "texto": [
      "It highlights a skill or an area in which someone excels: noun + **にかけては**. It can be said about oneself or about another person; the tone depends on the context: **にほんご にかけては、 だれ に も まけない** (when it comes to Japanese, no one can beat me)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜を経て: after passing through",
     "texto": [
      "To say that something reaches its end after going through several stages: noun + **を へて**: **いくつ か の だんかい を へて、 かんせい しました** (after several stages, it was completed).",
      "It is formal and is used in history and in processes."
     ],
